      "side": 1,
      "message": "IMPORTANT: With the `cm-\u003equant_params.base_qindex \u003c\u003d 140` check in the new speed feature, do we still need to check `cpi-\u003eoxcf.rc_cfg.cq_level \u003c\u003d 220`?\n\n(This is a question, not a suggestion.) These two checks seem a litte redundant. Perhaps we just need to check one of them?",
