      "writtenOn": "2025-12-03T18:11:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Optional: We can restructure these two assignments so that the complicated expression for `should_reduce_cdef_strengths` is evaluated only when necessary.\n\n```\n  bool should_zero_cdef_strengths \u003d false;\n  if (cpi-\u003esf.lpf_sf.zero_low_cdef_strengths) {\n    should_zero_cdef_strengths \u003d\n      cdef_control \u003d\u003d CDEF_ADAPTIVE \u0026\u0026 cpi-\u003eoxcf.mode \u003d\u003d ALLINTRA \u0026\u0026\n      (cpi-\u003eoxcf.rc_cfg.mode \u003d\u003d AOM_Q || cpi-\u003eoxcf.rc_cfg.mode \u003d\u003d AOM_CQ) \u0026\u0026\n      cpi-\u003eoxcf.rc_cfg.cq_level \u003c\u003d 220;\n  }\n```\n\nAlternatively we can omit the intermediate variable `should_reduce_cdef_strengths` and chain everything:\n\n```\n  const bool should_zero_cdef_strengths \u003d\n      cpi-\u003esf.lpf_sf.zero_low_cdef_strengths \u0026\u0026\n      cdef_control \u003d\u003d CDEF_ADAPTIVE \u0026\u0026 cpi-\u003eoxcf.mode \u003d\u003d ALLINTRA \u0026\u0026\n      (cpi-\u003eoxcf.rc_cfg.mode \u003d\u003d AOM_Q || cpi-\u003eoxcf.rc_cfg.mode \u003d\u003d AOM_CQ) \u0026\u0026\n      cpi-\u003eoxcf.rc_cfg.cq_level \u003c\u003d 220;\n\n```",
      "revId": "cb6faf2358eef455948ddf38dcee20552084df33",
