      "writtenOn": "2025-12-03T18:11:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Optional: The new `num_planes \u003e 1` check makes the nesting of these if statements a little hard to understand. I suggest we first reduce the luma strengths, and then reduce the chroma strengths if `num_planes \u003e 1`. This structure mirrors the code above that calculates the luma and chroma strengths.\n\n```\n        if (is_low_luma_strength) {\n          cdef_info-\u003ecdef_strengths[j] \u003d 0;\n        }\n        if (num_planes \u003e 1) {\n          const int chroma_strength \u003d cdef_info-\u003ecdef_uv_strengths[j];\n          const int pri_chroma_strength \u003d chroma_strength / CDEF_SEC_STRENGTHS;\n          const int sec_chroma_strength \u003d chroma_strength % CDEF_SEC_STRENGTHS;\n          const bool is_low_chroma_strength \u003d\n              pri_chroma_strength \u003c\u003d 4 \u0026\u0026 sec_chroma_strength \u003c\u003d 1;\n\n          // Disable CDEF on chroma if we\u0027ve disabled it on luma\n          if (is_low_luma_strength || is_low_chroma_strength) {\n            cdef_info-\u003ecdef_uv_strengths[j] \u003d 0;\n          }\n        }\n```\n\nWe can even have an early continue if `is_low_chroma_strength` doesn\u0027t need to be evaluated.\n\n```\n        if (is_low_luma_strength) {\n          cdef_info-\u003ecdef_strengths[j] \u003d 0;\n        }\n        if (num_planes \u003e 1) {\n          if (is_low_luma_strength) {\n            // Disable CDEF on chroma if we\u0027ve disabled it on luma\n            cdef_info-\u003ecdef_uv_strengths[j] \u003d 0;\n            continue;\n          }\n          const int chroma_strength \u003d cdef_info-\u003ecdef_uv_strengths[j];\n          const int pri_chroma_strength \u003d chroma_strength / CDEF_SEC_STRENGTHS;\n          const int sec_chroma_strength \u003d chroma_strength % CDEF_SEC_STRENGTHS;\n          const bool is_low_chroma_strength \u003d\n              pri_chroma_strength \u003c\u003d 4 \u0026\u0026 sec_chroma_strength \u003c\u003d 1;\n\n          if (is_low_chroma_strength) {\n            cdef_info-\u003ecdef_uv_strengths[j] \u003d 0;\n          }\n        }\n```",
      "revId": "cb6faf2358eef455948ddf38dcee20552084df33",
